    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired; temperature to 37.6 °C; no shaking chills</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Cough with white sputum; no shortness of breath at rest or wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or tightness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild nausea after breakfast on varenicline</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Grief therapy going on; sleeping about five hours; no thoughts of death or suicide</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
